---
import { coreOrderPolicy } from '../core-order-policy.mjs';
const { slug } = Astro.props;
const bubble = slug === 'poly-bubble-mailers';
const name = bubble ? 'Bubble Mailers' : 'Poly Mailers';
const packingTarget = bubble ? '#brief-specification-checks' : '#brief-notes';
---
<section class="section bulk-mailer-orders" id="bulk-repeat-orders" aria-labelledby="bulk-repeat-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">For wholesale buyers &amp; repeat orders</p><h2 id="bulk-repeat-heading">Wholesale {name}: Bulk &amp; Repeat Orders</h2><p class="lead">Prepare a bulk purchase or repeat run against a clear specification. Keep bag versions, quantities, artwork and delivery requirements together in your enquiry.</p></div></div>
    <p class="bulk-minimum">Minimum order: {coreOrderPolicy.pieces} pieces. {coreOrderPolicy.breakdown} {coreOrderPolicy.configuration}</p>
    <div class="bulk-order-grid">
      <article>
        <p class="eyebrow">Compare quantities</p><h3>Quote the Same Bag at Different Quantities</h3>
        <p>Ask for alternatives such as 500, 1,000 and 3,000 pieces of the same size and artwork. {bubble ? 'Keep the exterior, bubble lining, usable space and closure the same.' : 'Keep the film, single-wall thickness, usable size and closure the same.'} List other sizes or designs as separate versions.</p>
        <p>Request product, setup, sample-related and delivery charges separately so each quotation can be compared on the same basis.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="#quote-delivery-checks" data-open-delivery-brief>Compare quantities &amp; delivery in my brief ↑</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="eyebrow">Prepare a repeat order</p><h3>Identify the Approved Version and Any Changes</h3>
        <p>In Additional requirements, include the previous quote or sample reference, specification date and artwork revision. List changes to size, material, printing, quantity or destination, or ask us to review the same specification.</p>
        <p>Ask us to reconfirm the offered construction, sample checks, current pricing and timing for this run. Attach relevant artwork or specification files on the enquiry page.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="#brief-notes" data-open-spec-brief>Add repeat-order details to my brief ↑</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="eyebrow">Plan the shipment</p><h3>Confirm Packing and Delivery Requirements</h3>
        <p>Share target counts per bundle or carton, any assortment or carton-marking request, and the delivery country and ZIP/postal code. Ask for the offered carton dimensions and weight when comparing freight options.</p>
        <p>Leave undecided requirements open. Packing options and included, separate or pending delivery charges are confirmed in the written quotation.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={packingTarget} data-open-spec-brief>Add packing requirements to my brief ↑</a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="bulk-next-step"><p><strong>Keep the approved references together.</strong> Review the <a href="/guides/compare-custom-mailer-quotes/">quote comparison checklist</a> and <a href="/guides/custom-mailer-sample-approval/">sample approval checks</a>. For production responsibility or supporting records, <a href={`/materials-and-documents/?product=${slug}#document-request-builder`}>prepare a product-specific document request</a>.</p><a class="button button-secondary" href={`/quote/?product=${slug}#quote-form`} data-quote-placement="product-details">Use a Blank {bubble ? 'Bubble Mailer' : 'Poly Mailer'} Enquiry</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .bulk-mailer-orders h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.2vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.2;text-wrap:balance}
  .bulk-mailer-orders{scroll-margin-top:110px}.bulk-mailer-orders .section-head{margin-bottom:20px}.bulk-minimum{max-width:1000px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:28px}.bulk-order-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px}.bulk-order-grid article{min-width:0;border-top:2px solid var(--line);padding-top:22px}.bulk-order-grid h3{font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.35;margin:12px 0 16px}.bulk-order-grid p{line-height:1.7}.bulk-order-grid .eyebrow{font-size:.75rem;margin:0}.bulk-order-grid .text-link{display:inline-block;line-height:1.6;margin-top:8px}.bulk-next-step{margin-top:32px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--cream)}.bulk-next-step p{margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.75}.bulk-next-step p a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.bulk-next-step .button{white-space:normal;text-align:center}
  @media(max-width:760px){.bulk-order-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}.bulk-order-grid h3{font-size:1.1rem}.bulk-next-step{padding:20px}.bulk-next-step .button{width:100%}}
</style>
